-RFC 1275            Replication Requirements             November 1991</t>
+        <name slugifiedName="name-status-of-this-memo">Status of this Memo</name>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-boilerplate.1-1">This memo provides information for the Internet community.  It
+does not specify an Internet standard.  Distribution of this memo
+is unlimited.</t>
       </section>
